<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n43959" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sescentēni</span></b> , also <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sescēni</span></b>  (less cor. rectly <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sexc-</span></b> ), ae, a, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>num. distrib.
			adj.</i> [sescenti], <i>six hundred each.</i>
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b> Form sescenteni: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">sescenteni malleoli,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 5, 3</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">urnae,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">id. 3,
					9, 3</span></i>
			; cf. <i><span class="en">Suet. Claud. 32</span></i>;
					<i><span class="en">Mart. Cap. 6, §
			610</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			Form sesceni: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">Varro prodidit, singula jugera vinearum
					sescenas urnas vini praebuisse,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Col.
					3, 3, 2</span></i>
			 nummi, <i><span class="en">Cic. Verr. 2, 5, 25, § 62</span></i>: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">denaril equitibus tributi,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Curt.
					5, 1, 45</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">annua,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Plin.
					29, 1, 5, § 7</span></i>
			.</div>
    </div> <div class="alpheios-lex-footnotes en"> </div>
